      <li>Do not plan around a later State Civil Service-to-IAS promotion as a guaranteed backup; that route is narrow and slow.</li>
      <li>Both paths provide income stability but also hierarchy, transfers, public accountability, and limits on autonomy or outside paid work. Keep a current skill and realistic backup alive during preparation.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

